   "titulo": "Active and passive voice",
   "texto": [
    "In an active prayer, the subject performs the action: **Masyarakat menghormati pahlawan**. In the passive, who receives the action can move to the beginning: **Pahlawan dihormati oleh masyarakat**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The meng- and di- prefixes",
